4. MEMORY RETRIEVAL DURING ORCHESTRATION
==================================================

Implement the integration flow:

Orchestration Request
        ↓
Intent Detection
        ↓
Context Preparation
        ↓
Memory Retrieval
        ↓
Memory Context Integration
        ↓
Routing / Planning / Execution
        ↓
Aggregation
        ↓
Memory Event / optional persistence

The exact ordering must respect the existing AG-001 lifecycle.

Do NOT rewrite AG-001's execution pipeline.

If the current AG-001 architecture has no memory stage, create an
adapter/hook rather than modifying the core engine unnecessarily.

